@startuml
title Neural Network Architecture for Fraud Detection

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam arrowColor black

rectangle "Input Layer\n7 neurons" as input #lightblue
rectangle "Hidden Layer 1\n12 neurons" as h1 #lightcyan
rectangle "Hidden Layer 2\n8 neurons" as h2 #lightcyan  
rectangle "Hidden Layer 3\n4 neurons" as h3 #lightcyan
rectangle "Output Layer\n1 neuron" as output #lightgreen

input --> h1
h1 --> h2
h2 --> h3
h3 --> output

note bottom of input
  Input Features:
  Transaction Amount, Time Since Last Transaction,
  Transaction Velocity, Geographic Risk Score,
  Device Reputation, Payment Method Risk,
  Customer History Score
end note

note bottom of output
  Model Details:
  Optimizer: Adam (lr=0.001)
  Loss: Binary Cross-Entropy
  Metrics: AUC, Precision, Recall
  Output: Fraud probability (0-1)
end note

@enduml 